# Timestamped copies of the Kobo's KoboReader.sqlite land here on every sync —
# the only copy of your highlights + reading positions. The .sqlite files are
# git-ignored (personal data); only this placeholder is tracked.
#
# Restore: with the Kobo plugged in, copy a backup back over the device DB —
#   cp backups/KoboReader-<stamp>.sqlite "/Volumes/KOBOeReader/.kobo/KoboReader.sqlite"
#   rm -f "/Volumes/KOBOeReader/.kobo/KoboReader.sqlite-wal" \
#         "/Volumes/KOBOeReader/.kobo/KoboReader.sqlite-shm"
# then eject. (Close any reading session / fully sync the Kobo first.)
